{"availability":"available","full":"iainchesworthlabs/iclforge","name":"iclforge","description":"A clean-room AC-3, E-AC-3 and AC-4 encoder and decoder in C++23, implemented from the published standards. It turns PCM into AC-3, E-AC-3 or AC-4 streams, turns mono sources placed and moved in 3D space into E-AC-3 with Joint Object Coding, and reads those streams back.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C++","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-09T06:35:05Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:20:21Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://iainchesworthlabs.github.io/iclforge/","topics":["ac-3","ac-4","audio-codec","cpp23","dolby-atmos","e-ac-3","esp32","sendspin"],"demo":"https://iainchesworthlabs.github.io/iclforge/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.500Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.500Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.500Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.500Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ICL Forge is a clean-room AC-3, E-AC-3, AC-4 and Dolby Atmos codec, written from the published standards in C++23, and the applications built on it.","The AC-3, E-AC-3 and AC-4 codecs link no other codec library, FFmpeg included. The FFmpeg command-line tools, and a librempeg build for AC-4, are used during development as independent decoders to check output against; the build does not depend on them. Hearth's Sendspin transport links libFLAC and Opus for the audio formats Sendspin itself defines.","Standards and trademarks. \"Dolby\", \"Dolby Digital\" and \"Dolby Atmos\" are trademarks of Dolby Laboratories. This project implements the openly published standards — ATSC A/52:2018 (of which E-AC-3 is normative Annex E), ETSI TS 102 366, ETSI TS 103 420 and ETSI TS 103 190 (AC-4) — and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or certified by Dolby Laboratories. Code and documentation use the technical names AC-3, E-AC-3 and AC-4. Whether the patents reading on these formats matter for your use is your problem to assess, not something this project resolves."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iainchesworthlabs/iclforge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b72625d1106f06bd2c64a96e1874226149d063f4e2430a3be0b5f8e9ac89aa2a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.584Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.584Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ICL Forge is a clean-room AC-3, E-AC-3, AC-4 and Dolby Atmos codec, written from the published standards in C++23, and the applications built on it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iainchesworthlabs/iclforge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b72625d1106f06bd2c64a96e1874226149d063f4e2430a3be0b5f8e9ac89aa2a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iainchesworthlabs/iclforge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.584Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T07:20:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iainchesworthlabs/iclforge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:54.585Z","hash":"b72625d1106f06bd2c64a96e1874226149d063f4e2430a3be0b5f8e9ac89aa2a","originalBytes":29177,"storedBytes":29177,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","ac-4","forge","library","hearth","iclforge","crucible","decode","e-ac-3","ac-3","libs","atmos","decoder","apps","built","object","run","dolby","each","encode","gui","index.md","sendspin","tests","every","audio","codec","linux","one","over","player","runs","what","ac3","objects","platforms","real","sink","build","component","live","own","project","see","source","under","windows","board","does","ffmpeg","macos","published","quality","validation","which","against","encoder","independent","quick","release","them","time","tools","where","beside","bindings","checks","cli","demos","desktop","encoding","engine","esp32","firmware","forge-gui","mode","platform","python","read","shield","streams","test","their","without","ac-4.","android"